  "hudPotionGame": "The potion is everything you invested, together: capital that works for you and yields with no effort of yours. From half a month of income stored on it earns a class — semi, regular, super and hyper — one more for every extra half month.",
  "hudPotionFinance": "Finance: it's your invested balance divided by this month's expected income — how many months of bills it already covers. Emergency money and goal money add up together: one is for what you did not see coming, the other for what you already planned (a trip, a purchase), and both do the same job — keeping the day-to-day bills untouched.",
